# Task 162-016 Execution Plan

## Goal
READ-ONLY audit of `src/orchestra/task-router.ts`, `src/orchestra/rule-evolver.ts`,
`src/orchestra/outcome-tracker.ts`. Output single audit report at
`docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-016-orch-router-evolve.md`.

## Approach
1. Read all three source files (≤2000 LoC total)
2. Read related types: routing-types, outcome-tracker types, condition-evaluator
3. Apply 10 audit dimensions per file
4. Verify lead questions:
   - 6-level routing priority (config → force → agent → skill → worker → fallback per ADR-015)
   - learning bonus correctness (recordOutcome → applyLearningBonus delta)
   - synergy matrix (agent×skill pair tracking)
5. Severity classify findings: P0/P1/P2/P3
6. Migration triage per file: KEEP-PRIVATE | MIGRATE-PUBLIC | DELETE-CANDIDATE | UNCERTAIN

## Output
Single report file (mandatory format: Scope, Findings, Evidence, Migration triage,
Recommendation). Severity-ordered findings with file:line citations.

## Constraints
- READ-ONLY: NO source code edits
- scope.filesWrite contains exactly ONE path: the audit report
- ADR-039 self-modifying detector active
- Build/test verify (tsc + vitest) is N/A per task spec but I will run tsc to ensure
  audit report doesn't accidentally break build
